---
---

<section id="about" class="py-34 md:py-42 lg:py-48 relative">
  <div class="container-main">
    <!-- Section header — lots of room -->
    <div class="reveal mb-24 lg:mb-34">
      <div class="label mb-8">About</div>
      <h2 class="font-heading text-h1 text-white max-w-2xl">
        Accelerating the Decentralization of Global Markets
      </h2>
    </div>

    <!-- Two-column narrative -->
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 lg:gap-24">
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 reveal">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-steel-300 leading-[1.85] mb-8">
          Decentralized exchanges have come a long way since the early days of EtherDelta.
          Today, DEXs account for more than 20% of total crypto trading volume — driven
          by the rapid rise of platforms like Jupiter and Hyperliquid.
        </p>
        <p class="text-body-lg text-steel-300 leading-[1.85]">
          Yet despite this progress, decentralized markets still lag behind
          centralized exchanges when it comes to asset coverage and pricing efficiency.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 reveal reveal-delay-2">
        <p class="text-body-lg text-steel-300 leading-[1.85] mb-12">
          Affine Trading was founded to bridge that gap. We focus on market making
          within DeFi markets, helping align DEX pricing with CEX benchmarks and
          driving liquidity where it's needed most.
        </p>

        <!-- Mission statement — visually distinct -->
        <div class="pl-6 border-l border-accent/30">
          <p class="text-body text-steel-200 italic font-heading text-h4 leading-relaxed">
            Our mission is to accelerate the decentralization of global trading
            infrastructure.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Stats row — lots of breathing room -->
    <div class="mt-30 lg:mt-42 pt-16 border-t border-white/[0.04]">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-12 lg:gap-20 stagger-children">
        <div class="group">
          <div class="font-heading text-h1 text-white mb-3 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-gradient">20%+</div>
          <div class="text-body-sm text-steel-500">Of crypto volume now trades on DEXs</div>
        </div>
        <div class="group">
          <div class="font-heading text-h1 text-white mb-3 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-gradient">24/7</div>
          <div class="text-body-sm text-steel-500">Always-on liquidity provision</div>
        </div>
        <div class="group">
          <div class="font-heading text-h1 text-white mb-3 transition-colors duration-500 group-hover:text-gradient">&lt;50ms</div>
          <div class="text-body-sm text-steel-500">Quote response latency</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
